  objectiveText: Reach the Station
  introText: "Your ship's engine has died near a ruined orbital structure. The only
    replacement is inside an abandoned station \u2014 on the far side of a field
    of shattered wreckage.\n\nA bends gravity inside the glowing zones. B can freeze
    one object at a time and steer it.\nNeither of you can make it alone."
  completeTitle: STATION REACHED
  completeText: The airlock seals behind you. Somewhere inside this upside-down station
    is the engine vault...
  isFinalStage: 0
  holdToResetSeconds: 1
  playAmbience: 1
